<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>binds to q and e
Use to quick peak corners with minimal effort  
You might also need to change the side button input to your in game lean button bind if you dont have side buttons.
This macro will get you easy kills and win you more gunfights!

</Description>
    <Comment>Good luck operator!</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Button5Down 1
Delay 20 ms
Button5up 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 120 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 75 ms
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 20 ms
Button5Down 1
Delay 20 ms
Button5up 1
Delay 95 ms
KeyUp 4 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>